 - Kept the wrapper functions to preserve intent at call sites (Rule 2: Reveals Intent)\n\n2. **Replaced mutable loop with `reduce` in `processClaim`** (Rule 2 + Rule 3)\n   - Removed `let totalPayout` and explicit `for...of` loop\n   - Summation intent is now self-documenting\n\n3. **Simplified `processScenario` iteration with `.entries()`** (Rule 2: Reveals Intent)\n   - Replaced manual index management (`let stepIndex`, `< .length`, `+= 1`) with destructured `for...of`\n   - Removed error-prone manual index bookkeeping\n\n4. **Clarified comment in `adjustedDamageFor`** (Rule 2: Reveals Intent)\n   - Replaced misleading dragon-material comment with intent-focused explanation\n\n### Tests\n\nAll tests remain green:\n\n```\n✓ src/claim-office.spec.ts  (45 tests | 9 skipped)\nTest Files  1 passed (1)\nTests  36 passed | 9 todo (45)\n```"}],"details":{"mode":"single","agentScope":"both","projectAgentsDir":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_19-37-06_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_kimi-k2-7/.pi/agents","results":[{"agent":"refactor","agentSource":"project","task":"Test file: src/claim-office.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim-office.ts\nPassing tests: 36\nRecent Green phase: Added claim damage count validation against insured item counts\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done.","exitCode":0,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task: Test file: src/claim-office.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim-office.ts\nPassing tests: 36\nRecent Green phase: Added claim damage count validation against insured item counts\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done."}],"timestamp":1784924445741},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to refactor the implementation in src/claim-office.ts while keeping all tests green. I need to follow the refactoring rules from m